Third-party notices

This project distributes no Spotify code and no third-party extension code.
At install time it downloads extensions from their own public repositories and
installs a stylesheet written for this project. Each downloaded extension keeps
its own license; see docs/SAFETY.md. Spotify, Spicetify and every listed
extension are the property of their respective owners.
